<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Day 11 - CSS Display & Position</title>

    <style>

        /* TASK 1 - HORIZONTAL MENU */

        .menu {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0;
        }

        .menu li {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            background-color: lightblue;
            font-size: 16px;
            
        }

        /* TASK 2 - CENTERED BLOCK */

        .box {
            width: 50%;
            border: 2px solid black;
            padding: 20px;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Day 11 - CSS Display & Position</h1>

    <!-- TASK 1-->

    <h2>Task 1 - Horizontal Menu</h2>
    <ul class="menu">
        <li>Home</li>
        <li>About</li>
        <li>Services</li>
        <li>Products</li>
        <li>Contact</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- TASK 2-->

    <h2>Task 2 - Centered Block</h2>

    <div class="box">
        This is a 50% width box.
        It is centered horizontally using margin: 0 auto.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
